      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U06_L03_Q16</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.AR.7</p><p>If (6, 8) satisfies the cost constraint but violates the item-limit constraint, what is true?</p>]]></text>
