      <text>ALG1_U06_L03_Q18</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U06_L03_Q18</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.AR.7</p><p>For 4x + 6y &gt;= 100 and x + y &lt;= 30, is (20, 5) feasible?</p>]]></text>
