    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U06_L03_Q20</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.AR.7</p><p>What should be checked first when interpreting an ordered pair in context?</p>]]></text>
