    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG1_U06_L03_Q21</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A1.AR.6</p><p>A ticket booth sells adult tickets for 12 dollars and student tickets for 8 dollars. Which expression represents the total revenue for a adult tickets and s student tickets?</p>]]></text>
